    <marc:datafield tag="520" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
      <marc:subfield code="a">The Jungle Book by Rudyard Kipling, read by Rhashan Stone. Saved from the jaws of the evil tiger Shere Khan, young Mowgli is adopted by a wolf pack and taught the law of the jungle by lovable old Baloo the bear and Bhageera the panther. The adventures of Rikki-Tikki-Tavi the snake-fighting mongoose, little Toomai and the elephant&apos;s secret dance, and Kotick the white seal are all part of Mowgli&apos;s extraordinary journey with his animal friends</marc:subfield>
